{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j","cve_id":"CVE-2026-94545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/security-advisories/GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/security/advisories/GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j","summary":"Remote Code Execution in next/og ImageResponse","description":"## Impact\r\n\r\nThe Node.js `ImageResponse` implementation from `next/og` is affected by an upstream vulnerability. This can lead to remote code execution.\r\n\r\nAffected applications pass attacker-controlled values into SVG content, attributes, or styles during image generation:\r\n\r\n```tsx\r\nimport { ImageResponse } from 'next/og'\r\n\r\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\r\n  const value = new URL(request.url).searchParams.get('value') ?? ''\r\n\r\n  return new ImageResponse(\r\n    <svg width=\"1200\" height=\"630\">\r\n      <title>{value}</title>\r\n    </svg>\r\n  )\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nApplications using the Edge `ImageResponse` implementation, or applications that do not pass attacker-controlled values into SVG content, attributes, or styles, are not affected.\r\n\r\n## Workaround\r\n\r\nIf upgrading is not immediately possible, do not pass attacker-controlled values into SVG content, attributes, or styles rendered by the Node.js `ImageResponse` implementation from `next/og`.","severity":"critical","author":null,"publisher":{"login":"KarimPwnz","id":14217083,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjE3MDgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14217083?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarimPwnz","html_url":"https://github.com/KarimPwnz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarimPwnz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarimPwnz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarimPwnz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarimPwnz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarimPwnz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarimPwnz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarimPwnz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarimPwnz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KarimPwnz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2026-94545","type":"CVE"}],"state":"published","created_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-09-22T17:03:51Z","published_at":"2026-09-22T17:03:51Z","closed_at":null,"withdrawn_at":null,"submission":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"npm","name":"next"},"vulnerable_version_range":">= 16.2.0 < 16.3.6","patched_versions":"16.3.6","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":null,"score":null},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:H/SI:H/SA:H","score":9.5}},"cwes":[],"cwe_ids":[],"credits":[{"login":"RaghavMaheshwari124","type":"finder"},{"login":"rafabd1","type":"finder"}],"credits_detailed":[{"user":{"login":"RaghavMaheshwari124","id":142688382,"node_id":"U_kgDOCIFAfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142688382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaghavMaheshwari124","html_url":"https://github.com/RaghavMaheshwari124","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaghavMaheshwari124/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaghavMaheshwari124/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaghavMaheshwari124/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaghavMaheshwari124/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaghavMaheshwari124/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaghavMaheshwari124/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaghavMaheshwari124/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RaghavMaheshwari124/events{/privacy}","received_ev